---
import SimplePage from '../../../components/content/SimplePage.astro';
import { getCtaLinks } from '../../../lib/cms.ts';
const { bookUrl, healthCheckUrl } = await getCtaLinks();
---

<SimplePage
  title="Checklists"
  description="Practical document checklists and preparation resources for Australian visa and skills-assessment applications."
  eyebrow="Knowledge Centre"
  lead="Well-prepared applications start with the right documents — gathered early, in the right order."
  cta={{ href: bookUrl, label: 'Book a consultation' }}
  disclaimer={true}
>
  <p>
    Much of a strong application is preparation: the right evidence, assembled carefully and lodged
    on time. Because every matter is different, the documents you need depend on your visa and your
    circumstances — so at Visa &amp; Migration Doctors your checklist is prepared for your specific
    case, not a generic list.
  </p>
  <p>
    We're adding downloadable, pathway-specific checklists to this page. In the meantime, the
    fastest way to know exactly what to prepare is a personal assessment:
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li>
      <a href={healthCheckUrl}>Start the free Visa Health Check</a> — a quick read on where you stand
      and what matters most.
    </li>
    <li>
      <a href={bookUrl}>Book a consultation</a> — leave with a clear, written list tailored to your matter.
    </li>
  </ul>
</SimplePage>
